**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery Mission**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Target Condition / Enquired Info** | **Relation** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|-------------------------------------|--------------|-------------------|
| G1 | Deliver requested resources to the specified location | `;` | Achieve | *Resources are physically delivered to the destination* | AND | Collection must finish before delivery can start. |
| G2 | Collection Phase | `FALLBACK(G2.1,G2.2)` | Perform | – | OR | Two mutually exclusive paths: normal collection or battery‑low fallback. |
| G2.1 | Normal Collection | `;` | Perform | – | AND | Steps must be executed in order (navigate → request → wait). |
| G2.1.1 | Navigate to Storage | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must physically reach the storage. |
| G2.1.2 | Request Resources | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must send a request message. |
| G2.1.3 | Wait for Retrieval | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must wait until the storage delivers the items. |
| G2.2 | Battery‑Low Collection | `;` | Perform | – | AND | Must return to recharge and hand off the task. |
| G2.2.1 | Return to Recharge | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must reach the charging station. |
| G2.2.2 | Assign Mission to Another Robot | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Remaining task must be reassigned. |
| G3 | Delivery Phase | `FALLBACK(G3.1,G3.2)` | Perform | – | OR | Normal delivery or battery‑low fallback. |
| G3.1 | Normal Delivery | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Deliver the collected resources. |
| G3.2 | Battery‑Low Delivery | `;` | Perform | – | AND | Must return to checkpoint and hand off remaining work. |
| G3.2.1 | Return Resource to Checkpoint | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Robot must bring the resource to a safe spot. |
| G3.2.2 | Assign Remaining Task to Another Robot | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Remaining delivery work must be reassigned. |
| G4 | Failure Handling & Alert | `#` | Perform | – | AND | Both alert and report must be executed. |
| G4.1 | Trigger Alert | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Sector manager must be notified. |
| G4.2 | Send Report | `-` | Perform | – | AND | Detailed report must be sent. |

