### Task Model

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|-------------------|
| AT1 | Navigate to storage location | AND | storage | 1 | Robot must physically reach the storage. |
| AT2 | Request resources from storage | AND | storage | 1 | Robot must send a request message. |
| AT3 | Wait until resources are retrieved | AND | storage | 1 | Robot must wait for the storage to deliver. |
| AT4 | Return to recharging station | AND | recharge | 1 | Robot must recharge before continuing. |
| AT5 | Assign remaining collection task to another robot | AND | base | 1 | Continuation of the mission. |
| AT6 | Return resource to checkpoint | AND | checkpoint | 1 | Safe return of the resource. |
| AT7 | Assign remaining delivery task to another robot | AND | base | 1 | Continuation of the delivery. |
| AT8 | Trigger alert to sector manager | AND | base | 1 | Immediate notification of failure. |
| AT9 | Send report to sector manager | AND | base | 1 | Documentation of the incident. |
| AT10 | Deliver resources to destination | AND | delivery location | 1 | Final delivery step. |

